---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Meet the founder — a Baltimore-based web designer focused exclusively on helping local small businesses get found online and win more customers."
>
  <!-- OUR STORY -->
  <section class="bg-cream dark:bg-bg py-16 md:py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink mb-10">Our Story</h1>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start mb-12">
        <div class="space-y-5 text-muted leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            We started VerumWeb after noticing the same problem everywhere.
          </p>
          <p>
            Great small businesses were getting overlooked online — not because they weren't good, but because their websites were outdated, nonexistent, or just not working for them. Meanwhile, competitors with weaker service were winning simply by showing up better online.
          </p>
          <p>
            With how fast things are changing — especially with AI — that gap is only getting bigger.
          </p>
          <p>
            We didn't want to build another agency that overcomplicates things. We started VerumWeb to make it simple for good businesses to look as strong online as they actually are — and to give them tools that will still matter a few years from now.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Headshots -->
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 items-center md:items-start">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-48 h-56 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/joshface.jpg" alt="Josh — co-founder" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted text-center">Josh</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-48 h-56 rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/vilnisface.jpg" alt="Vilnis — co-founder" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted text-center">Vilnis</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Baltimore Connection -->
      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink mb-4">Our Baltimore Connection</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          <p>
            We've spent the last few years in Baltimore, getting to know the city beyond just campus.
          </p>
          <p>
            From Charles Village to Hampden and Canton, we've seen how many strong local businesses rely on word of mouth but don't have that same presence online.
          </p>
          <p>
            We've talked to owners who know they need to improve digitally — they just don't know where to start or who to trust. That's exactly who we built this for.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Who We Work With -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-ink mb-4">Who We Work With</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          <p>
            We work best with business owners who care about what they've built.
          </p>
          <p>
            Contractors, auto shops, gyms, restaurants — the kinds of businesses that are already solid but just haven't caught up online yet.
          </p>
          <p>
            We're not chasing big corporate clients. The work that matters to us is helping local businesses get more calls, more customers, and a website that actually works. Simple as that.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT WE BELIEVE -->
  <section class="bg-cream dark:bg-bg py-16 md:py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink mb-8">What we believe.</h2>
      <dl class="space-y-6">
        {[
          {
            term: 'A website should make you money, not just look nice.',
            detail: 'Design is a means to an end. The end is customers calling, booking, or buying. Every decision gets made with that lens.',
          },
          {
            term: 'Clients should own their site. Always.',
            detail: "Your domain is in your name. Your files are yours. You're not renting from me — I'm building something for you.",
          },
          {
            term: 'Local businesses deserve the same quality big companies pay for.',
            detail: "A plumber in Dundalk deserves a fast, professional website just as much as a firm in Harbor East. The budget is different; the quality doesn't have to be.",
          },
          {
            term: 'Transparent pricing is a form of respect.',
            detail: "If I can't tell you what it costs upfront, something's wrong. You shouldn't have to sit through a sales call to find out if you can afford to work with me.",
          },
          {
            term: 'Plain language is a professional standard.',
            detail: "I'll never use jargon you have to Google. If I can't explain it simply, I haven't understood it well enough.",
          },
        ].map(({ term, detail }) => (
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="shrink-0 mt-1 text-success dark:text-navy-light" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <div>
              <dt class="font-bold text-ink mb-1" style="font-family: var(--font-sans);">{term}</dt>
              <dd class="text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">{detail}</dd>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA
    heading="Want to work together?"
    subheading="Let's start with a free 15-minute call. No pitch, no pressure — just a conversation."
    primaryText="Book a call"
    primaryHref="https://calendly.com/TODO"
    secondaryText="Or request a free audit"
    secondaryHref="/audit"
    theme="dark"
  />
  <!-- TODO: Replace Calendly URL above with your real booking link -->
</Layout>
